":"2018-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Matson","x":"Fred, it sounds like you're not too worried about the China potential trade war but I just wanted to get maybe a little more detail there around your thinking on that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/25/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q2-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2018 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2018-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"So again, in our last-half of the year, we raised guidance by about $16 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/25/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q2-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2018 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"We added about $1.2 million in tariffs that we thought we would see on the initial round, essentially both are in place and I'll ask Raul in just a second, if those tariffs are still in place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2018 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Jim Sidoti","x":"And then any change from the tariffs, has that gotten any better or worse for the last three months?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2018 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"The margin improvement is built up of several different pieces, specifically from a mix of operational efficiencies, cost saving initiatives and our recent acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2018 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"We always have a cost-cutting initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jim Sidoti","x":"I think historically, you've always kind of maintained outlook after the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-07-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"This reflects an adjusted margin decline in the quarter as compared to the prior year, which was negatively impacted by FX of 20-basis points due to the strengthening of the U.S. dollar, tariffs by 25-basis points, an unfavorable product mix of 102 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-07-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"The change in our margins is coming from what we have seen in the first half of the year, which is FX headwinds, tariffs and the demand on our legacy products, which have lower margins than our corporate margins, along with the unfavorable sales mix from our IOS division and Aspira sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"I say that the thunderstorm has passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"But the bottom line is, it will pass-through rather quickly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"This reflects a margin decline in the quarter as compared to the prior year, which was negatively impacted by FX tariffs by 20 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"I'll be happy to discuss the second, or excuse me the third quarter, but again, as you all know, there were a number of circumstances and without trying to blame or all this and that, everybody understands things like FX and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"And that will be a permanent cost saving.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"We also had some headcount reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"I think we've cut our outlook for acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"Our cost savings materialized, and we expect to continue that into 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2019 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"These cost savings came from our San Jose office consolidation, reduced headcount and discretionary expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"Overall, we are pleased with how our operating margin improvement plan is going, and it was nice to be able to deliver continued cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"Those cost savings, as Fred mentioned, came from -- principally from our San Jose office consolidation; a leaner R&D process; reduced headcount; and lower discretionary expenses, including travel and trade shows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"Our decision to withdraw our guidance is centered on the unpredictability, resulting from the volume of data points and wide variations within these data points feeding into our models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/merit-medical-systems-mmsi-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"These cost savings came primarily from lower employee costs, R&D, and lower discretionary expenses including travel, trade shows, marketing, and promotions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"Since then, we've identified a few other cost saving measures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"The reduction in SG&A expense was a result of cost-cutting initiatives and other cost management efforts related to the COVID-19 pandemic, including layoffs, targeted furloughs and temporary salary reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"The reduction in R&D expenses was largely due to lower compensation expenses, lower discretionary expenses as a result of cost-cutting initiatives and the COVID-19 pandemic, and more focused research and development program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"The reduction in SG&A expenses were a result of cost-cutting initiatives and other cost management efforts related to COVID-19 pandemic including layoffs, targeted furloughs and temporary salary reductions and lower discretionary spending as a result of reduced travel, training and shows and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2020 Q4","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"…were a result of cost-cutting initiatives and other cost management efforts related to COVID-19 pandemic including layoffs, targeted furloughs and temporary salary reductions and lower discretionary spending as a result of reduced travel, training and shows and conventions among other items.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2021 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"The reduction in SG&A expenses were a result of lower compensation expenses as a result of reduced head count from cost-cutting initiatives in 2020 and lower discretionary spending as a result of reduced travel, training and shows and conventions during the COVID-19 pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2021 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jayson Bedford","x":"So I'm just wondering is there anything out there that you can point to as a reason for not raising guidance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2021 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jim Sidoti","x":"Are you do you have pricing power or do you have hedges in place on the materials and you able to handle some inflation in the near term?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2021 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"…expense including commissions and bonus expense and other increase in sales year-over-year and lower opex in Q2 2020 from cost cutting initiatives, lower headcount and lower discretionary spending as a result of the reduced travel, training and shows and conventions during the COVID 19 pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2021 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"We're seeing price increases coming from vendors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2021 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred Lampropoulos","x":"We have our own foundry, but we're able to raise prices to our customers and offset those costs and we have control of the supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2021 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"…expense including commissions and bonus expense on the increase in sales year-over-year and lower OpEx in Q3 of 2020 from cost-cutting initiatives, lower headcount and lower discretionary spending as a result of reduced travel, training, and shows and conventions during the COVID 19 pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/merit-medical-systems-inc-mmsi-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"Q1 gross margin included a $4.6 million impact from tariffs, compared to no impact in the prior-year period, representing a 120 basis point impact to gross margin in the period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/merit-medical-mmsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"For avoidance of doubt, our 2026 non-GAAP EPS guidance continues to assume a twelve-month tariff impact of approximately $15 million, or $0.19 per share, compared to a $9 million, or $0.12 per share, impact realized during the last eight months of 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/merit-medical-mmsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"On the positive side, we have yet to receive any price increases from our vendors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/merit-medical-mmsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Martha Aronson","x":"…I have been working through a comprehensive analysis of the business and it became clear during this process that we had an opportunity to streamline our internal planning and reporting processes with the goal of aligning how we think about, evaluate, and plan each of our underlying businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/merit-medical-mmsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Martha Aronson","x":"We also identified an opportunity to streamline how we talk about the business externally as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/merit-medical-mmsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q1","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Michael John Petusky","x":"I guess there was not much in the way other than, I guess, the reaffirmed guide on Rhapsody.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/merit-medical-mmsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martha Aronson","x":"Importantly, our financial results included a benefit from tariff refunds in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/merit-medical-mmsi-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q2","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"Excluding $6.9 million of refunds related to previously paid i.e. for tariffs recognized within cost of sales, gross profit increased 12% and our gross margin was 54.2%, up 98 basis points year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/merit-medical-mmsi-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"So we're expecting another, let's say, $1.3 million or so in tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/merit-medical-mmsi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"The other piece is really around Section 232.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/merit-medical-mmsi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Raul Parra","x":"We've raised the guidance on the low end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/merit-medical-mmsi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMSI 2026 Q3","e":"mmsi","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Zachary Gold","x":"I know you guys are reiterating the guide here at $7 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/merit-medical-mmsi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,12111,0,0,0,9722,1786],[36,1,11041,0,0,0,9587,833],[37,1,7532,0,0,0,6611,510],[38,1,10361,0,0,0,9167,819],[39,1,13700,0,0,0,11274,2012],[40,1,11399,0,0,0,9803,1159],[41,1,12767,0,0,0,10853,1459],[42,1,11903,0,0,0,9812,1602],[43,1,6773,0,0,0,5384,995],[44,1,9160,0,0,0,7702,1046],[45,1,9159,0,0,0,8004,783],[46,1,10153,0,0,0,9057,724],[47,1,9242,0,0,0,8149,700],[65,1,8320,0,0,0,3530,4370],[66,1,9623,0,0,0,8187,1045],[67,1,9241,0,0,0,7593,1156]],"cinema":[[34,1,12111,0,0,0,9722,1786],[36,1,11041,0,0,0,9587,833],[37,1,7532,0,0,0,6611,510],[38,1,10361,0,0,0,9167,819],[39,1,13700,0,0,0,11274,2012],[40,1,11399,0,0,0,9803,1159],[41,1,12767,0,0,0,10853,1459],[42,1,11903,0,0,0,9812,1602],[43,1,6773,0,0,0,5384,995],[44,1,9160,0,0,0,7702,1046],[45,1,9159,0,0,0,8004,783],[46,1,10153,0,0,0,9057,724],[47,1,9242,0,0,0,8149,700],[